{
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFD\\,#FAF2F9)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A191E\\,#221D26)@90"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "{nm.y}+({nm.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#B4329B|#EE7FD6",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "_note": "源色身份点(组件设计系统 §2):每个组件恰好一次,y 锚在组件名的实测框上。"
      },
      {
        "id": "nm",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23.0pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "190pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${p},${@i18n.noPkg})]",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "at",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "15pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-28.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "alignmentH": "2",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${endM},--)]",
        "fontSize": "9pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "数据时间锚 = 数据截至日(MM-DD),不是取数时刻 —— 三个源都滞后 1~4 天,写取数时刻是在骗人。"
      },
      {
        "id": "lab",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "33pt",
        "w": "156pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${ecoL},--)] · $[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),d),${@i18n.pullL},if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),b),${@i18n.i30L},${@i18n.wk7}))]",
        "fontSize": "10.5pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
        "_note": "副标题行距组件名盒顶 19pt,与同包 pkg / release / detail / board / cmp 一致(v3 是 18,cmp 是 17)。"
      },
      {
        "id": "num",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "48pt",
        "w": "160pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),findNotEmpty::(${wkZ},--),findNotEmpty::(${wkE},--))]",
        "fontSize": "34pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),findNotEmpty::(${wkZ},--),findNotEmpty::(${wkE},--)),--),1,0)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "numE",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "59.25pt",
        "w": "160pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "--",
        "fontSize": "34pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),findNotEmpty::(${wkZ},--),findNotEmpty::(${wkE},--)),--),0,2)]"
      },
      {
        "id": "tri",
        "type": "path",
        "x": "14.0pt",
        "y": "96pt",
        "w": "8pt",
        "h": "5.3pt",
        "d": "$[if::(eq::(${up},1),M128 64 L240 192 L16 192 Z,M128 192 L16 64 L240 64 Z)]",
        "viewBox": "0 0 256 256",
        "fillColor": "$[if::(eq::(${flat},1),#9AA0A6|#8E939B,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${up},__none__),__none__),#9AA0A6|#8E939B,if::(eq::(${up},1),if::(eq::(${up},1),#B4329B|#EE7FD6,#B45309|#F5A524),if::(eq::(${up},0),if::(eq::(${up},1),#B4329B|#EE7FD6,#B45309|#F5A524),#9AA0A6|#8E939B))))]",
        "hide": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${flat},1),0,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${up},__none__),__none__),0,if::(eq::(${up},1),1,if::(eq::(${up},0),1,0)))),1),0,1)]"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${flat},1),0,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${up},__none__),__none__),0,if::(eq::(${up},1),1,if::(eq::(${up},0),1,0))))]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "chg",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "26.0pt",
            "y": "92pt",
            "w": "144.0pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${chgT} ${@i18n.vsWk}",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "$[if::(eq::(${flat},1),#9AA0A6|#8E939B,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${up},__none__),__none__),#9AA0A6|#8E939B,if::(eq::(${up},1),if::(eq::(${up},1),#B4329B|#EE7FD6,#B45309|#F5A524),if::(eq::(${up},0),if::(eq::(${up},1),#B4329B|#EE7FD6,#B45309|#F5A524),#9AA0A6|#8E939B))))]"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(${flat},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "chgF",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "92pt",
            "w": "156pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${@i18n.flatMsg}",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),s),if::(eq::(${flat},1),0,if::(eq::(if::(eq::(${flat},1),0,if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${up},__none__),__none__),0,if::(eq::(${up},1),1,if::(eq::(${up},0),1,0)))),1),0,1)),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "chgN",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "92pt",
            "w": "156pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "-- ${@i18n.vsWk}",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),d),if::(eq::(${updToday},1),0,1),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "altD",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "92pt",
            "w": "156pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${@i18n.updA}${updAgo}${@i18n.updB}",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "typeface": "System-Bold"
          }
        ],
        "_note": "Docker Hub / Homebrew 没有逐日数据,这一行不报涨跌(不编日增);换成一句中性的事实。"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${kind},s),d),if::(eq::(${updToday},1),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "altT",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "14.0pt",
            "y": "92pt",
            "w": "156pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "${@i18n.updTd}",
